+    <section class="ops-sim" id="ops-sim" aria-labelledby="ops-title">
+      <h2 id="ops-title">Operations Queue Simulator</h2>
+      <p class="ops-intro">
+        Long-running jobs are split into small slices and scheduled by priority.
